 "summary": "This is a mutual NDA between Northwind Labs, Inc. and Orchard Data Ltd., effective 2025-11-09 and governed by Delaware law. Confidentiality obligations last only one year from disclosure, and the agreement has no stated term, liability cap, or termination clause."
